---
import SocialButtons from './SocialButtons.astro';
---
<section class="section reveal" id="about-preview">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-panel">
     <div class="profile-card">
  <div class="profile-image-wrap profile-image-photo">
    <img
      src="/images/Randroom18022024_noback.png"
      alt="Corey Voller"
      onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='grid';"
    />

  </div>

  <h2>Corey</h2>
  <p>Statistician · PhD researcher · software developer</p>

  <SocialButtons compact />
</div>

      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="tag">About</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">about<span class="brace">&#123;</span>Corey<span class="brace">&#125;</span></h2>
        <!-- 
        <blockquote class="sidekick">
          Statistics, programming and visual explanation for medical research and trial methodology.
        </blockquote>
        -->
        <h3 class="about-subheading">Description</h3>
        <p>
        I'm Corey and I am currently a PhD Candidate at the University of Bath. My research lies in Bayesian adaptive designs. I am supervised by <a
    class="about-inline-link"
    href="https://www.zhengh-stats.co.uk/"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    Haiyan Zheng
  </a> and <a
    class="about-inline-link"
    href="https://people.bath.ac.uk/mascj/"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    Christopher Jennison
  </a>. I enjoy exploring ideas beyond routine analysis work, especially where methods can be made clearer through interactive graphics, reproducible notebooks or small pieces of software. I sometimes make fun (at least what I call fun) slides in Quarto or Manim (Math animation package). 
        
        </p>
        <p>
        I've tried to make this site a little interactive and have included some examples of animated slides here.
        </p>
        <p>
          My research focuses on Bayesian adaptive clinical trial designs, with broader interests in biostatistics,
          external data, evidence synthesis, R programming and practical teaching resources.
        </p>
<h3 class="about-subheading about-arguments-heading">Arguments</h3>
        <table class="about-meta" aria-label="About Corey details">
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>.focus</td><td>Bayesian adaptive clinical trials, small population designs, medical statistics and simulation.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>.tooling</td><td>R, Quarto, Git, HTML/CSS, Python, C#, dashboards and reproducible reports.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>.research</td><td>Efficient design and analysis of small population clinical trials with external data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>.teaching</td><td>Mathematics, statistics, R workflows and visual explanations of complex methods.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>.approach</td><td>Turn complicated statistical ideas into something people can inspect, question and use.</td></tr>
            <tr>
  <td>.badprogrammer</td>
  <td>
    <span class="lifecycle-table-item">
      <img
        src="/images/lifecycle-deprecated.svg"
        alt="Deprecated"
      />
    </span>
  </td>
</tr>

<tr>
  <td>.names</td>
  <td>
  Corey
    <span class="lifecycle-table-item">
      <img
        src="/images/lifecycle-stable.svg"
        alt="Stable"
      />
    </span>
  </td>
</tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
